  "details": "I'm currently facing an issue with the blocked users list. The page only displays a maximum of 100 blocked users, but our group definitely has more than that. Unfortunately, there’s no option to navigate to additional pages (e.g., no page 2 or 3 buttons). When I remove one user from the list, another name appears, indicating that there are more users blocked than what’s visible.\n\nRecently, we accidentally blocked someone from joining the group, and now it’s impossible to unblock them without clearing the entire list. This limitation is causing significant problems for us.\n\nCould you please address this issue by adding pagination or a “load more” button? This would help us manage the blocked list more effectively and ensure we can unblock specific users without having to remove others.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.",
